      "The model most often recommended by people already deep in the barefoot category",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Men's sizing only — our #1 is unisex",
      "The aggressive tread is unnecessary, and noisier, if you are mostly indoors on hard floors",
      "30-day Amazon returns and no size-exchange programme, against 90 days on our #1",
    ],
    blurb:
      "The outdoor answer rather than the all-day-standing answer. Different job to our #1.",
  },
  {
    rank: 4,
    name: "HOBIBEAR Wide Minimalist Barefoot Sneakers",
    brand: "HOBIBEAR",
    score: 8.1,
    scoreLabel: "Very Good",
    grade: "B",
    bestFor: "Best Budget Pick",
    verdict:
      "The cheapest honest way into the category. Unisex, zero drop, wide — you are giving up finish quality and long-term durability, not the core geometry.",
    metrics: [
      { label: "Toe Box Width", value: 86 },
      { label: "All-Day Comfort", value: 78 },
      { label: "Weight", value: 85 },
      { label: "Value for Money", value: 93 },
      { label: "Buyer Protection", value: 80 },
    ],
    trustNote: "Amazon returns policy applies",
    price: "Check price",
    image: "/images/gf-hobibear.webp",
    url: AMZ("B0CD6R33W6", "hobibear"),
    ctaLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    pros: [
      "Zero drop and a wide forefoot at the lowest price on this list",
      "Unisex sizing, so it works as a trial pair for either partner",
      "Light and flexible",
    ],
